# 4. Core layout

## 4.1 Screen structure

Every main screen should follow this vertical structure:

```txt
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Status / small controls      │
│ RESONA logo                  │
│ mode subtitle                │
│                              │
│ Main Sound Matter            │
│ glass / liquid / merge nodes │
│                              │
│ interaction hint / status    │
│ level / timer / resonance    │
│                              │
│ optional loop chips          │
│ Matter selector              │
│ Capture / Merge buttons      │
└─────────────────────────────┘
```

## 4.2 Mobile-first target

The first UI target is a portrait mobile screen.

Reference aspect:

```txt
9:16
```

Preferred app max width:

```css
max-width: 430px;
```

The UI should still work responsively on desktop by centering the mobile app shell.

