# 6. Matter types

## 6.1 MatterType enum

```ts
export type MatterType = "glass" | "liquid" | "bloom";
```

Future matter types may include:

```ts
"crystal" | "gravity" | "particle" | "fabric"
```

Do not implement future types in the first prototype unless explicitly requested.

---

## 6.2 Glass

### Sound association

* glass bell
* FM-like tone
* bright pluck
* transparent pad
* crystalline echo

### Visual association

* crystal orb
* refraction
* sharp highlights
* concentric orbit rings
* thin light paths

### Interaction feel

* tap = glass bell
* swipe = light scratch / pitch glide
* hold = frozen tone
* hum = melody trace inside orb

---

