## 7.2 Component responsibilities

### ResonanceApp

Owns the main app state.

State:

```ts
type AppMode = "solo" | "capture" | "merge";
type MatterType = "glass" | "liquid" | "bloom";

type ResonanceAppState = {
  mode: AppMode;
  matter: MatterType;
  level: number;
  resonance: number;
  elapsedSeconds: number;
  loops: LoopItem[];
  participants: Participant[];
};
```

### AppShell

Provides the mobile app container, background, safe area, and main layout.

### Header

Displays:

* logo
* subtitle
* optional left control
* optional right menu/share control

### SoundMatterCanvas

Displays the central visual matter object.

It should support:

```ts
type SoundMatterCanvasProps = {
  mode: AppMode;
  matter: MatterType;
  level: number;
  resonance?: number;
  isRecording?: boolean;
};
```

### MatterSelector

Displays Glass / Liquid / Bloom.

Props:

```ts
type MatterSelectorProps = {
  selected: MatterType;
  onChange: (matter: MatterType) => void;
};
```

### LevelMeter

Displays the segmented level bar.

Props:

```ts
type LevelMeterProps = {
  level: number;
};
```

### PrimaryActions

Displays Capture and Merge buttons.

Props:

```ts
type PrimaryActionsProps = {
  mode: AppMode;
  onCapture: () => void;
  onMerge: () => void;
};
```

### CaptureTimer

Displays recording state and timer.

Props:

```ts
type CaptureTimerProps = {
  elapsedSeconds: number;
  statusText: string;
};
```

### LoopChips

Displays captured loops.

Props:

```ts
type LoopChipsProps = {
  loops: LoopItem[];
  onRemove?: (id: string) => void;
  onAdd?: () => void;
};
```

### MergeNetwork

Displays participants and connected resonance orbs.

Props:

```ts
type MergeNetworkProps = {
  participants: Participant[];
  resonance: number;
};
```

### ResonanceMeter

Displays resonance percentage and waveform bars.

Props:

```ts
type ResonanceMeterProps = {
  resonance: number;
};
```

