# 10. Accessibility and usability

## 10.1 Basic requirements

Even though the visual design is dark and atmospheric, the UI must remain readable.

Minimum requirements:

* button labels must be clear
* active states must not rely only on color
* touch targets should be at least 44px high
* main controls should be reachable with thumbs
* text contrast should be sufficient
* motion should be subtle enough to avoid discomfort

## 10.2 Reduced motion

Eventually support:

```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)
```

In reduced motion:

* stop orbital movement
* reduce glow pulsing
* reduce particle animations
* keep state changes visible through opacity and static rings

