# 14. Notes for developers

* Start with static UI.
* Do not implement microphone first.
* Do not add complex settings.
* Do not overbuild audio features before the look is right.
* The central visual object is the product identity.
* Every screen should feel like the same product system.
* Matter types should change both sound association and visual material.
* Capture and Merge are the two core verbs.
* Resonance is the preferred public-facing term for multi-user sync quality.
